"Search orders by phone as owner of shop A, expecting only shop A's orders (shopId filtering boundary)",Order Search by Phone - Shop-Scoped Results,Boundary,High,"Two shops exist (A with ID 1, B with ID 2). Customer 'John' with phone '+1234567890' has one order in shop A and one order in shop B. Authenticated as owner of shop A.","1. Authenticate as owner of shop A. 2. Send GET request to /api/orders/by-phone?phone=+1234567890&page=0&limit=10

