Send request with expired JWT token (expiration boundary),JWT Token Validation - Error Handling,Boundary,High,"A valid JWT token that was generated with past expiration time (e.g., expired 1 minute ago)","1. Send GET request to /api/orders/shop/1 with header ""Authorization: Bearer <expired_token>""

