Send request with malformed JWT token (malformed boundary),JWT Token Validation - Error Handling,Boundary,High,"A JWT token string that is not properly formatted (e.g., missing parts, random string)","1. Send GET request to /api/orders/shop/1 with header ""Authorization: Bearer not.a.valid.jwt.token""

