Send CORS preflight OPTIONS request to protected endpoint (OPTIONS method boundary),CORS Preflight - OPTIONS Request Handling,Boundary,High,No authentication - this tests that OPTIONS requests pass through without authentication,"1. Send OPTIONS request to /api/orders/shop/1 with headers ""Origin: http://example.com"", ""Access-Control-Request-Method: GET"", ""Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization""

