"Get last measurement for customer as owner of shop A, where customer has measurements in both shop A and shop B (shopId filtering boundary)",Last Measurement Lookup - Shop-Scoped Results,Boundary,High,"Two shops exist (A with ID 1, B with ID 2). Customer has orders with measurements in both shops. Authenticated as owner of shop A.","1. Authenticate as owner of shop A. 2. Send GET request to /api/orders/last-measurement?phone=+1234567890&customerId=1&itemId=1 with shop context of shop A

